{{Transclude|Adversary System/Weapons#Kuva Acquisition}}

==Notes==
*Normal burst fire has significantly more recoil when fired from the hip.
*The [[Alternate Fire]] of the Kuva Kraken will eject ''all'' of the remaining ammunition in the magazine in a single burst.
**Base "real" fire rate is '''20''' rounds per second.
**Increasing the magazine size of the weapon such as with {{M|Slip Magazine}} ({{M|Primed Slip Magazine|Primed}}) and using recoil reduction mods like {{M|Steady Hands}} can help to make its damage output more consistent and reliable.
**If buffed with unlimited ammo such as from the [[Void Fissure#Reactant Buff|Reactant Buff]], the weapon will only fire its magazine amount at a time, with small delays between each trigger pull.
**The burst can be interrupted with a quick melee attack, dodge roll, or weapon swap.
*The ability to to unload all its magazine in one powerful burst is shared with the Corpus {{Weapon|Tenet Detron}}, {{WF|Octavia}}'s {{Weapon|Pandero}} ({{Weapon|Pandero Prime|Prime}}), and the [[Amalgam]] {{Weapon|Cyanex}}.
